title: Files and folders are dragged in the list to move or copy them, with a question for a name that exists and for another folder, undo, cut and paste, a delete that asks, and files dropped from the system
folders: tree-move, tree-other
prefs: {"autosave": false}
fixtures: tree-outside
expect-log: files: Moved "notes.md" to docs
expect-log: files: Moved "notes.md" to the folder's root
expect-log: files: refused: "docs" cannot go into a folder inside itself
expect-log: files: Copied "b.txt" to lib
expect-log: files: undone
expect-log: files: Moved 2 items
expect-log: files: "from-explorer.txt" was copied in from outside into docs
expect-file: tree-move/notes.md :: # Notes
expect-file: tree-move/src/a (2).txt :: root a
expect-file: tree-move/src/a.txt :: src a
expect-file: tree-move/b.txt :: root b
expect-file: tree-move/lib/b.txt :: root b
expect-file: tree-move/lib/readme.md :: # Readme
expect-file: tree-move/docs/c.txt :: root c
expect-file: tree-move/docs/d.txt :: root d
expect-file: tree-move/docs/from-explorer.txt :: dropped from the system
expect-file: tree-move/src/keep.txt :: ZZkeep
absent-file: tree-move/lib/keep.txt
expect-file: tree-other/other.txt :: other
expect-file: tree-other/extra.txt :: root extra
expect-file: tree-outside/from-explorer.txt :: dropped
absent-file: tree-move/a.txt
absent-file: tree-move/extra.txt
absent-file: tree-move/docs/notes.md
absent-file: tree-move/docs/readme.md
absent-file: tree-move/lib/extra.txt
absent-file: tree-move/c.txt
absent-file: tree-move/d.txt

wait 3500
left files
wait 1200
files click docs
wait 400
files click lib
wait 400
files mods none
mark list
wait 300
files drag notes.md docs
wait 2200
mark moved-into-docs
wait 400
files drag docs/notes.md empty
wait 2200
mark moved-back-to-the-root
wait 400
files hold docs docs/guide
wait 2200
mark refused-into-itself
wait 1500
files release docs/guide
wait 600
files drag a.txt src
wait 2200
mark clash-asks
wait 1500
answer Keep both
wait 1200
files mods ctrl
wait 200
files hold b.txt lib
wait 2200
mark copy-ghost
wait 1500
files release lib
wait 1200
files mods none
wait 300
files drag extra.txt lib
wait 2200
files key ctrl+z
wait 1200
mark undone
wait 300
files click docs/readme.md
wait 300
files key ctrl+x
wait 300
files click lib
wait 300
files key ctrl+v
wait 1500
files click lib/keep.txt
wait 300
files key delete
wait 1500
mark delete-asks
wait 1500
answer Cancel
wait 500
files click c.txt
wait 300
files mods ctrl
wait 200
files click d.txt
wait 400
files mods none
wait 300
wait 1500
mark two-selected
files drag d.txt docs
wait 2200
mark two-moved
wait 300
files drop-os {FIX}\tree-outside\from-explorer.txt docs
wait 1500
edit lib/keep.txt 1 1
wait 400
type ZZ
wait 500
files drag lib/keep.txt src
wait 3000
mark moved-with-unsaved-text
wait 1500
files drag extra.txt tree-other
wait 3500
mark across-asks
wait 1500
answer Move
wait 1500
mark done
wait 500
quit
